import "res://resources/dialogues/map_common.dialogue" as common

~ start
Wandering Trader: Care to browse my wares?
- Sure thing, let me see what you have for sale. => start_trade
- #roll_convince Don't you think those prices are a bit unfair?
- See you later. [leave] => common/finish_dialogue

~ start_trade
Wandering Trader: Please, have a look!
=>< common/start_trade
~ after_trade
Wandering Trader: Pleasure doing business with you! 
=> start

~ convince_success
Wandering Trader: #persuaded I see you have a touch for bargain, that's hard to come by in these lands.\n
[resource trade prices have been improved by 10%] => start
=>< common/improve_prices
=> start
 
~ convince_fail
Wandering Trader: #angry If you don't like my prices, then go buy someplace else!\n
[resource trade have been worsened by 10%] => start
=>< common/strain_prices
=> start